#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:222
msgid "``image.ImageIO`` stream mode and ``close()`` *(minor)*"
msgstr "Način rada toka i ``close()`` kod ``image.ImageIO`` *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.8.0.rst:224
msgid ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` — the ``mode`` argument now accepts only lowercase "
"``'r'`` / ``'w'`` (uppercase is rejected with an updated error message), and"
" opening with ``'w'`` always truncates/recreates the file instead of "
"preserving an existing stream. ``ImageIO.close()`` is now idempotent "
"(closing an already-closed stream no longer raises) and returns ``None`` "
"instead of the stream object."
msgstr ""
":class:`image.ImageIO` — argument ``mode`` sada prihvaća samo mala slova "
"``'r'`` / ``'w'`` (velika slova se odbijaju uz ažuriranu poruku o grešci), a"
" otvaranje s ``'w'`` uvijek skraćuje/ponovno stvara datoteku umjesto da čuva"
" postojeći tok. ``ImageIO.close()`` je sada idempotentan (zatvaranje već "
"zatvorenog toka više ne podiže iznimku) i vraća ``None`` umjesto objekta "
"toka."

